    "A native database client for PostgreSQL and MySQL.\n\nCopyright © 2026 David Vaníček\n\nTessera is free software under the GNU General Public License, version 3. You may redistribute and modify it under those terms. It comes with absolutely no warranty.\n\nIncludes third-party open-source components (MIT and Apache-2.0 licensed); their notices are in THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md alongside the source.": {
